<title>USA: Met-Pro sets new 100,000 shr buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Met-Pro sets new 100,000 shr buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>HARLEYSVILLE, Pa. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Met-Pro Corp said on Tuesday it initiated a new 100,000 share stock repurchase program, after completing its 75,000 share buyback program.</p>
<p>Purchases would be made over the next 12 months in open market transactions, the company said, adding it could discontinue the program at any time.</p>
<p>Met-Pro makes air/water pollution control systems, fluid handling equipment for corrosive, abrasive and high temperature liquids, filter products for drinking water and specialty chemicals for controlling corrosion.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
